{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/deferredtask"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A deferred unit of asynchronous work that produces a result of type "},{"code":"Success","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredTask","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Success","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Success","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"DeferredTask","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" represents an asynchronous operation that is defined but does not start executing until it is explicitly started.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This allows precise control over when the asynchronous work begins, supporting scenarios where you want to set up an async operation ahead of time and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"trigger its execution at a chosen moment.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This type conforms to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsynchronousUnitOfWork","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol and is useful for wrapping async computations, network requests, or any other asynchronous operation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that may throw an error and returns a value.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Basic usage with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"execute()"},{"text":" to start and await the operation:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<Int> {","    try await Task.sleep(nanoseconds: 1_000_000_000)","    return 42","}","let result = try await deferred.execute()","print(\"Result is \\(result)\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accessing the result via the ","type":"text"},{"code":"result","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property (an async property that awaits completion):","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<Int> {","    10 * 5","}","let value = await deferred.result","print(\"Value is \\(value)\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Running the operation without awaiting its result immediately, via ","type":"text"},{"code":"run()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<Int> {","    7 + 3","}","deferred.run()","\/\/ Later, you may await the result property or handle completion otherwise"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Subscribing to the task’s events using ","type":"text"},{"code":"subscribe()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<String> {","    \"Hello, World!\"","}","let cancellable = deferred.subscribe { event in","    switch event {","    case .success(let value):","        print(\"Completed with value: \\(value)\")","    case .failure(let error):","        print(\"Failed with error: \\(error)\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Storing the subscription in a collection for lifecycle management:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var cancellables = Set<AnyCancellable>()","let deferred = DeferredTask<Void> {","    print(\"Task executed\")","}","deferred.subscribe().store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Chaining with operators:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let result = try await DeferredTask { 21 }","    .map { $0 * 2 }","    .execute() \/\/ result is 42"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeferredTask","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DeferredTask.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/DeferredTask.swift#L79"},"externalID":"s:7Afluent12DeferredTaskC","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredTask","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"title":"DeferredTask","symbolKind":"class"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/init(operation:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/state"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/Actor-Implementations","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/AsynchronousUnitOfWork-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsynchronousUnitOfWork","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/ScA"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP"},"doc://Afluent/docum